EXPECT_HAS | e3/transcript.txt | GRADUATED \p from=preschool \p to=elementary_hs \p by=auto | transcript-row
RUN | $T/eg.+x | advance | $T/e3 | $T/curriculum.pdl | auto
EXPECT_EXIT | 3 | no-evidence-for-next-grade
EXPECT_OUT | NOT_READY elementary_hs | out-no-evidence-for-next-grade
